  "description": "Shared Quartz integration abstractions for AutoRegisterDependency: the [Job] attribute, version-neutral job scanner and plugin base types, and the JobDetail/Trigger registration helper. It does not reference Quartz.NET, so installing it alone starts no scheduler — Quartz3 and Quartz4 both build on it and pull it in transitively. Reference it directly only to build your own Quartz integration, or to consume [Job] metadata without taking a dependency on a scheduler.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
